    {
      "id": "509FDED7F0D4E1F4",
      "title": "&f&lKeep the cores, repeat the production&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fCore-bearing deployment steps retain their core. The final Sovereign Keystone imprints all five onto a Sovereign Core and finishes with the ordinary Enchanter’s Sword. Repeated boss kills can supply additional parallel catalyst stations.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fStore cores in a labelled secure inventory and keep them out of void or disposal upgrades.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
